{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/cd6b2dc3f126eb3bfb3ac3a2dfbc9542.avif?t=1758554573\" width=1024 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Renown</strong></i>, the open-world is your battlefield, and only the strongest will rule. Gather resources, build sprawling castles, and lead your clan into battle against rival players. Whether you're crafting siege engines to crush enemy walls, clashing swords in intense duels, or rallying your neighbors to destroy your enemies, prove your strength and become truly renowned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/1091b506796190463db0b65ef7345410.poster.avif?t=1758554573\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/1091b506796190463db0b65ef7345410.webm?t=1758554573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive and Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, gather, craft and build to carve out your stronghold in a world filled with those who want to take everything you own. Whether you prefer to farm the wilderness, forge weaponry for the frontline or build defensive structures for your group, there's always a job to be done to ensure your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/010d06dbeae31d94961b235fe31e252c.poster.avif?t=1758554573\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/010d06dbeae31d94961b235fe31e252c.webm?t=1758554573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand and Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From simple camps to mighty castles, they are all targets for your destruction. Fight for control over key points of interest, gather vital resources, and launch devastating sieges against rival strongholds. In the struggle for power, there can only be one winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/cfc0bd6bc77ba94ac21794d2211bfd0a.poster.avif?t=1758554573\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/cfc0bd6bc77ba94ac21794d2211bfd0a.webm?t=1758554573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is earned through skill, not chance. Wield a variety of medieval weapons and armor as you step onto the fray, where precise, skill-based combat decides your fate. One perfect strike, or a single fatal mistake can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/f4b2a44a547ea08cdbdca8fcd2bde9c3.poster.avif?t=1758554573\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/f4b2a44a547ea08cdbdca8fcd2bde9c3.webm?t=1758554573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Customisation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your knight freely with a vast selection of armor appearances, tabards, emblems, and color schemes. Whether you prefer to roam the battlefield as a robed monk or stand alongside warriors draped in red and white beneath a blood moon banner, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/10ec56f5f2fd9c2732d12e59964379ee.poster.avif?t=1758554573\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/10ec56f5f2fd9c2732d12e59964379ee.webm?t=1758554573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free and Lawless</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Renown is a place of little oversight, your decisions are yours to make and the only repercussions are those exercised by your enemies. Build anywhere, kill anyone, raid everyone, take everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/ae02496499b9eaa6ba1ade5c57e73cea.poster.avif?t=1758554573\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/ae02496499b9eaa6ba1ade5c57e73cea.webm?t=1758554573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast-paced PvP medieval survival with a strong emphasis on melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From building humble farms to huge fortresses, the choice is with the player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy all your neighbors with awe inspiring siege engines </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Group systems for making Claims, taking titles, giving ranks and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize everything from the helmet on your head to the banners on your base </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Server Progression and Wipe systems, for an engaging and vastly replayable experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools for Community Hosts to help tailor their servers. Future plans for extensive mod support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/e299a39ae463164df068d2c99a0590f3.poster.avif?t=1758554573\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/e299a39ae463164df068d2c99a0590f3.webm?t=1758554573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/495893d84789f8dd3e1231d1fe7d6e57.avif?t=1758554573\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Trial By Blade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1488310/03735e12232658de00484db4ad774606540cfc8b.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1488310?t=1758554573","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758554573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akama