onghold in a world filled with those who want to take everything you own. Whether you prefer to farm the wilderness, forge weaponry for the frontline or build defensive structures for your group, there's always a job to be done to ensure your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/010d06dbeae31d94961b235fe31e252c.poster.avif?t=1758554573\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/010d06dbeae31d94961b235fe31e252c.webm?t=1758554573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand and Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From simple camps to mighty castles, they are all targets for your destruction. Fight for control over key points of interest, gather vital resources, and launch devastating sieges against rival strongholds. In the struggle for power, there can only be one winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/cfc0bd6bc77ba94ac21794d2211bfd0a.poster.avif?t=1758554573\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488310/extras/cfc0bd6bc77ba94ac21794d2211bfd0a.webm?t=1758554573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is earned through skill, not chance. Wield a variety of medieval weapons and armor as you step onto the fray, where precise, skill-based combat decides your fate. One perfect strike, or a single fatal mistake c